<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Spanish first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>23 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>22 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>19 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>16 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>14 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Rivaldo</p>
<p>(Deportivo Coruna), Julen Guerrero</p>
<p>(Athletic Bilbao), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcelona), Corentin Martins (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>12 - Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Juan Eduardo</p>
<p>Esnaider (Atletico Madrid), Victor Fernandez</p>
<p>(Valladolid)</p>
</text>
